{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-09/1060710/block/singleImage/3250835/df/01M2RBKWSMMAWK5M8SCBSEJ4DN.jpg?updatedAt=1793163322\"/><figcaption>據報OpenAI計劃採購谷歌的AI晶片。(資料圖片/路透社)</figcaption></figure><p>The Information引述消息報道，美國人工智能（AI）公司OpenAI計劃採購Alphabet旗下谷歌（Google）的AI晶片，以進一步擴充其AI算力。 報道指，該計劃將深化OpenAI與谷歌之間的合作關係，儘管這兩家公司在AI產品和搜索領域存在競爭，但雙方的商業合作卻不斷擴大。 彭博報道指，OpenAI本身亦正在研發自家製AI晶片，並已聘用Google前資深員工協助發展，預計最快年底開始應用，挑戰輝達（Nvidia）在AI晶片市場的龍頭地位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:46.271786+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:55:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T21:58:06.876826+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:23.719882+00:00","content_hash":"210fd59aa42e26ce7b70cbfa9775433660c8f706a095f4c023315a91969019d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:46.271786+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}